MANDATORY ACADEMIC CITATION & ETHICAL USE REQUIREMENT
================================================================================
1. PROPER CITATION REQUIRED: Any research papers, journal articles, preprints,
   theses, dissertations, technical reports, presentations, web applications, or
   derived software packages that use, adapt, reproduce, or build upon:
   - The FiLM-RGCN graph neural network architecture,
   - The multi-relational 3D structural graph representation and 5 edge types,
   - The layer-wise pH Feature-wise Linear Modulation (FiLM) conditioning mechanism,
   - The dual-scale Fe-S active center exponential radial distance readout,
   - The curated 364-sample Fe-S redox benchmark dataset and multi-regime validation splits,
   - Or any accompanying code, models, figures, and experimental findings in this repository,
   MUST explicitly cite this GitHub repository (https://github.com/hubdk17/Redox_Potential)
   and the associated research article:
   "Predicting Iron–Sulfur Protein Redox Potentials Using a pH-Conditioned Relational Graph Neural Network"
   (Journal of Chemical Information and Modeling / JCIM).

